cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this analysis helps your work, cite this repository and the source datasets listed in REFERENCES.md."
type: software
title: "Ravel: Public Omics Reanalysis of Cellular States, Tissue Homeostasis and Disease"
authors:
  - family-names: "Xorca"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xorca0711/ravel"
url: "https://github.com/xorca0711/ravel"
abstract: >-
  A computational research project combining critical appraisal of primary
  literature, reproduction of accessible findings and integrative reanalysis
  of public omics and complementary experimental data. The project investigates
  cellular states and molecular programmes associated with tissue homeostasis,
  injury responses, repair, ageing and disease. Questions arising from published
  studies determine the relevant biological contexts, measurements and methods.
  Source evidence, computational inferences, competing explanations and
  interpretation limits are retained in a traceable research record.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - scanpy
  - multiomics
  - public data reanalysis
  - literature-guided research
  - hypothesis development
  - lineage tracing
date-released: 2026-09-10
